1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,981
AI can call a football match.

2
00:00:02,021 --> 00:00:03,525
Can it prove what it says?

3
00:00:03,565 --> 00:00:07,680
CRONISTA is a multi-agent broadcast where
every sentence is traceable.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,770
Six models are in the catalogue;

5
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:14,231
here GPT-6 Astra and GPT-6.1 Sol coach the two teams.

6
00:00:14,271 --> 00:00:19,390
Both receive the same committed observation
and return a plan for every player;

7
00:00:19,430 --> 00:00:21,610
a shared engine resolves the play.

8
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:27,450
Narrator (pre-match presentation): Welcome to the arena:
Juventud Caleteo against Racing Arenablanca.

9
00:00:28,199 --> 00:00:33,639
Narrator (pre-match presentation): Juventud Caleteo line up
in a five-three-two, with GPT-6 Astra in charge.

10
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:40,648
Narrator (pre-match presentation): Racing Arenablanca line up
in a three-five-two, with GPT-6.1 Sol in charge.

11
00:00:41,497 --> 00:00:42,193
Narrator (play-by-play): Ulises…

12
00:00:42,663 --> 00:00:52,951
Narrator (goal call): What a goal! Mateo Rosánez scores!
Juventud Caleteo take the lead, one–nil, after 47 seconds.

13
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:57,828
The commentator may only analyse with a cited fact.

14
00:00:57,868 --> 00:01:01,925
Eight deterministic rules check
citations, numbers, names and claims.

15
00:01:01,965 --> 00:01:06,200
A failed sentence is retried once, then
replaced by a labelled template.

16
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:09,519
The six models also play each other:

17
00:01:09,559 --> 00:01:14,389
a full league, won by GPT-6 Astra, and a
groups and knockout test bracket.

18
00:01:14,429 --> 00:01:19,390
Every match has a replay, and the page
states what the results cannot prove.

19
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:24,514
The same verifier guards the automated
recap, now with the arena's look:

20
00:01:24,554 --> 00:01:28,571
click any sentence to see its events, or
open every draft and verdict.

21
00:01:28,611 --> 00:01:30,890
We claim traceability, not better prose.

22
00:01:31,830 --> 00:01:37,433
It runs on Azure Container Apps with Blob, Key Vault,
Application Insights, Speech and Foundry.

23
00:01:37,473 --> 00:01:40,344
More than two thousand automated tests run in CI.

24
00:01:40,384 --> 00:01:41,770
Everything is synthetic.

25
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:44,740
CRONISTA: narrate the match, prove every sentence.
